{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25256","headline":"寒夜闻霜钟 · 卢景亮","name":"寒夜闻霜钟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洪钟发长夜，清响出层岑。\n暗入繁霜切，遥传古寺深。\n何城乱远漏，几处杂疎砧。\n已警离人梦，仍沾旅客襟。\n待时当命侣，抱器本无心。\n傥若无知者，谁能设此音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢景亮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25256.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25256","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}